ps://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"unlabeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2021-04-26T16:38:25Z","label":{"name":"postgresql","color":"60A070"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/826985141","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/6361#issuecomment-826985141","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/6361","id":826985141,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgyNjk4NTE0MQ==","user":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-04-26T16:38:41Z","updated_at":"2021-04-26T16:38:41Z","body":"hi there -\r\n\r\nas the creator of SQLAlchemy, it was apparent to me that your test case is using [an explciit Sequence object](https://docs.sqlalchemy.org/en/14/core/defaults.html?highlight=sequence#defaults-sequences), however, to the several other people here who generously help me quite a bit with triage for these issues, they might not realize that, so I would please ask that you provide [complete MCVE examples](http://stackoverflow.com/help/mcve) within the \"To Reproduce\" section, so that critical details like this are included.  thanks!\r\n\r\nthe bug is limited to when explicit sequences are in use, and would apply to any use of Sequence like on PostgreSQL, Oracle, etc.   \r\n\r\n\r\n```python\r\n\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import Column\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import create_engine\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import insert\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import Integer\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import literal_column\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import Sequence\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import String\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.ext.declarative import declarative_base\r\n\r\nBase = declarative_base()\r\n\r\n\r\nclass A(Base):\r\n    __tablename__ = \"a\"\r\n\r\n    id = Column(Integer, Sequence(\"a_seq\"), primary_key=True)\r\n    data = Column(String)\r\n\r\n\r\ne = create_engine(\"postgresql://scott:tiger@localhost/test\", echo=True)\r\nBase.metadata.drop_all(e)\r\nBase.metadata.create_all(e)\r\n\r\nfoo_table = A.__table__\r\nfoo_dicts = [{\"data\": \"d1\"}, {\"data\": \"d2\"}, {\"data\": \"d3\"}]\r\n\r\ninsert_query = (\r\n    insert(foo_table).values(foo_dicts).returning(literal_column(\"*\"))\r\n)\r\nwith e.begin() as conn:\r\n    objects = conn.execute(insert_query).fetchall()\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/826985141/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/827016729","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/6361#issuecomment-827016729","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/6361","id":827016729,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgyNzAxNjcyOQ==","user":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-04-26T17:27:08Z","updated_at":"2021-04-26T17:27:08Z","body":"for 1.3 you can work around this as follows:\r\n\r\n```python\r\n\r\nfoo_table = A.__table__\r\nseq = foo_table.c.id.default\r\nfoo_dicts = [\r\n    {\"id\": seq.next_value(), \"data\": \"d1\"},\r\n    {\"id\": seq.next_value(), \"data\": \"d2\"},\r\n    {\"id\": seq.next_value(), \"data\": \"d3\"},\r\n]\r\n\r\ninsert_query = (\r\n    insert(foo_table).values(foo_dicts).returning(literal_column(\"*\"))\r\n)\r\n\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/827016729/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/827019352","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/6361#issuecomment-827019352","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/6361","id":827019352,"node_id