ted_at":"2025-12-12T09:08:20Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-10T20:45:00Z","git_url":"git://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy","homepage":"https://www.sqlalchemy.org","size":99269,"stargazers_count":11252,"watchers_count":11252,"language":"Python","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":1606,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":205,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["python","sql","sqlalchemy"],"visibility":"public","forks":1606,"open_issues":205,"watchers":11252,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"### Describe the bug\r\n\r\nMalformed query has been rendered if used Sequence and literal_binds.\r\n\r\n### To Reproduce\r\n\r\n```python\r\n#!/usr/bin/env python3.9\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import Table, Integer, Column, String, insert, Sequence, MetaData\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.dialects import postgresql\r\n\r\nmetadata = MetaData()\r\n\r\ntable = Table('Test', metadata,\r\n    Column('pk', Integer, Sequence(\"pk_seq\"), primary_key=True),\r\n    Column('name', String),\r\n)\r\n\r\nstatement = insert(table).values([{ 'name': name } for name in ['foo', 'bar', 'baz']])\r\n\r\nprint(statement.compile(dialect=postgresql.dialect(), compile_kwargs={\"literal_binds\": True}))\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n### Error\r\n\r\nOutput:\r\n```\r\nINSERT INTO \"Test\" (pk, name) VALUES (nextval('pk_seq'), 'foo'), (%(pk_m1)s, 'bar'), (%(pk_m2)s, 'baz')\r\n``` \r\nAs you can see, the `nextval()` is applied only on the first value, remaining values are not rendered.\r\n\r\n### Versions\r\n\r\n- OS: Ubuntu 22.04\r\n- Python: 3.9\r\n- SQLAlchemy: 1.3.24\r\n- Database: Postgresql\r\n\r\n\r\n### Additional context\r\n\r\nNo database is needed in order to reproduce issue.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/8515/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/8515/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]